# iMessage Stack — a fanned deck of 10 pastel cards driven entirely by one
# invisible, inverted, paged horizontal FlatList: each card's scale, rotation,
# X/Y translation, perspective rotateY, swap offset and zIndex are aggressive
# interpolations of the scroll offset.
# What this test covers: card-by-card drags forward through the whole deck to
# the last card and overscroll past it, card-by-card back to the first, a
# half drag released before the snap point (springs back, mid-swap pose), a
# drag held exactly at a half card (perspective/swap midpoint), fast flings
# both ways (disableIntervalMomentum: one card per fling), and a fling stopped
# by a touch. The deck sits at y~460; drags are horizontal there.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/imessage-stack"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait 1000
# Forward card by card (inverted list: drag right).
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 140 460 140 0 500
wait 700
# Past the last card.
gesture pan 140 460 200 0 500
wait 1000
# Back, card by card.
gesture pan 280 460 -140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 280 460 -140 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 280 460 -140 0 500
wait 700
# Half drag released early, and one held at the swap midpoint.
gesture pan 200 460 -40 0 900
wait 900
gesture pan 200 460 -67 0 1500
wait 900
# Fast flings both ways.
swipe 330 460 60 460
wait 800
swipe 60 460 340 460
wait 800
swipe 330 460 60 460
wait 800
swipe 330 460 60 460
wait 800
# Fling then stop with a touch.
swipe 330 460 60 460
wait 100
press 200 460
wait 800
# All the way back to the first card.
gesture pan 280 460 -140 0 400
wait 500
gesture pan 280 460 -140 0 400
wait 500
gesture pan 280 460 -140 0 400
wait 500
gesture pan 280 460 -140 0 400
wait 500
gesture pan 280 460 -140 0 400
wait 500
gesture pan 280 460 -200 0 400
wait 1000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
